by TriangleMeshCurviLine. It seems that in your triangle mesh only
4 of 5 boundaries are of this type. 
 Specifically here's are the boundaries and theircurviness:
Boundary 0 is curvilinear.
Boundary 1 is curvilinear.
Boundary 2 is curvilinear.
Boundary 3 is curvilinear.
Boundary 4 is polygonal.
This only matters if you want to apply clamping-type
boundary conditions along those boundaries. Continue at your own risk
and/or make this message disappear by setting

     C1PlateHelper::Do_not_warn_about_polygonal_boundaries

to false. More intelligently, replace the polygonal boundaries
by TriangleMeshCurviLines. Alternatively, you can do the setup
yourself, of course. The black box function is only provided for
convenience and looking inside it will show you what needs to be done.

